{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01265",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.4,
      "end_seconds": 4.24,
      "duration_seconds": 2.84,
      "text": "Sorry I'm a little late, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.4,
      "end_seconds": 9.73,
      "duration_seconds": 4.33,
      "text": "No problem at all, come in. What's troubling you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 14.95,
      "end_seconds": 17.68,
      "duration_seconds": 2.73,
      "text": "Doctor, thank you for seeing us."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 18.92,
      "end_seconds": 22.56,
      "duration_seconds": 3.64,
      "text": "Yes, that's no problem at all. Please sit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 24.23,
      "end_seconds": 40.75,
      "duration_seconds": 16.52,
      "text": "I wanted to get breathlessness when I lie flat looked at. A neighbour of mine said I should see someone about it. I'd rather know what's going on than keep guessing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 41.27,
      "end_seconds": 44.05,
      "duration_seconds": 2.78,
      "text": "How long has it been like this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 47.2,
      "end_seconds": 60.63,
      "duration_seconds": 13.43,
      "text": "Honestly I can't say exactly when it started. It might have been last month or the month before, I really can't pin it down."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 61.18,
      "end_seconds": 70.08,
      "duration_seconds": 8.9,
      "text": "Ah. Tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 74.61,
      "end_seconds": 92.61,
      "duration_seconds": 18.0,
      "text": "It just comes and goes. I notice it more with lying flat. About a seven out of ten. Sitting up on pillows helps a bit. I, I had a dry cough at night before. That's settled now, though."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 93.97,
      "end_seconds": 98.55,
      "duration_seconds": 4.58,
      "text": "Any fainting, chest pain, calf pain or coughing up blood?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 99.39,
      "end_seconds": 102.62,
      "duration_seconds": 3.23,
      "text": "Uh, nope, nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 103.0,
      "end_seconds": 104.71,
      "duration_seconds": 1.71,
      "text": "Sure. Neurologically, anything strange?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 105.75,
      "end_seconds": 107.95,
      "duration_seconds": 2.2,
      "text": "No, that's all normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 109.02,
      "end_seconds": 112.98,
      "duration_seconds": 3.96,
      "text": "What about your tummy and bowels, anything unusual there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 114.97,
      "end_seconds": 117.51,
      "duration_seconds": 2.54,
      "text": "Nothing unusual, uh, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 119.48,
      "end_seconds": 122.65,
      "duration_seconds": 3.17,
      "text": "Are you on your own at home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 123.52,
      "end_seconds": 126.49,
      "duration_seconds": 2.97,
      "text": "I live with my elderly mother."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 128.02,
      "end_seconds": 129.8,
      "duration_seconds": 1.78,
      "text": "How active are you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 131.25,
      "end_seconds": 135.21,
      "duration_seconds": 3.96,
      "text": "I hardly move around during the day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 137.03,
      "end_seconds": 140.07,
      "duration_seconds": 3.04,
      "text": "What do you do during the day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 141.03,
      "end_seconds": 144.26,
      "duration_seconds": 3.23,
      "text": "I look after my grandchildren most days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 146.14,
      "end_seconds": 150.43,
      "duration_seconds": 4.29,
      "text": "Are there any allergies I should be aware of?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 151.3,
      "end_seconds": 157.14,
      "duration_seconds": 5.84,
      "text": "Yes, nickel, it gives me a rash on my skin."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 173.4,
      "end_seconds": 175.65,
      "duration_seconds": 2.25,
      "text": "Tell me your medicines, please."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 177.7,
      "end_seconds": 181.46,
      "duration_seconds": 3.76,
      "text": "Carvedilol, 6.25 milligrams, twice a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 181.98,
      "end_seconds": 187.78,
      "duration_seconds": 5.8,
      "text": "That's what's prescribed, but I'm not sure she takes it every day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 189.7,
      "end_seconds": 194.99,
      "duration_seconds": 5.29,
      "text": "I'm on aspirin, 75 milligrams, once a day for my heart."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 196.03,
      "end_seconds": 199.3,
      "duration_seconds": 3.27,
      "text": "How long have you been on it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 203.19,
      "end_seconds": 211.6,
      "duration_seconds": 8.41,
      "text": "About two years. Hydrochlorothiazide. I take it 12.5 milligrams, every morning for my pressure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 213.05,
      "end_seconds": 215.12,
      "duration_seconds": 2.07,
      "text": "When did you start it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 217.12,
      "end_seconds": 218.81,
      "duration_seconds": 1.69,
      "text": "For six months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 220.88,
      "end_seconds": 222.85,
      "duration_seconds": 1.97,
      "text": "What about your medical history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 224.57,
      "end_seconds": 237.29,
      "duration_seconds": 12.72,
      "text": "I've had heart failure for two years now. My family kept telling me to get it checked. I have heart disease. I've never really been one for hospitals."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 238.28,
      "end_seconds": 238.98,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 240.31,
      "end_seconds": 243.51,
      "duration_seconds": 3.2,
      "text": "I've had high blood pressure, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 246.91,
      "end_seconds": 257.17,
      "duration_seconds": 10.26,
      "text": "Right, so heart disease and high blood pressure are already on your record. We'll keep that in mind today. Have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 257.89,
      "end_seconds": 259.51,
      "duration_seconds": 1.62,
      "text": "No surgery, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 260.85,
      "end_seconds": 263.76,
      "duration_seconds": 2.91,
      "text": "I'll just record a few vital signs."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 275.62,
      "end_seconds": 278.7,
      "duration_seconds": 3.08,
      "text": "Right, keep your arm relaxed for me..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 296.01,
      "end_seconds": 304.38,
      "duration_seconds": 8.37,
      "text": "Okay: respiratory rate 20, pulse 104, temp 37.1 degrees, SpO2 93 percent on room air, pressure 141 over 76."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 307.12,
      "end_seconds": 310.53,
      "duration_seconds": 3.41,
      "text": "Okay, time for me to examine you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 322.18,
      "end_seconds": 323.87,
      "duration_seconds": 1.69,
      "text": "Fine by me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 325.61,
      "end_seconds": 326.82,
      "duration_seconds": 1.21,
      "text": "Look straight ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 334.23,
      "end_seconds": 336.1,
      "duration_seconds": 1.87,
      "text": "Neck veins are raised."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 337.53,
      "end_seconds": 340.33,
      "duration_seconds": 2.8,
      "text": "I'll listen to your chest now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 355.82,
      "end_seconds": 360.75,
      "duration_seconds": 4.93,
      "text": "I can hear crackles at the bases of both lungs."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 363.35,
      "end_seconds": 372.04,
      "duration_seconds": 8.69,
      "text": "You can relax now. Right, here's what I'm thinking. It points towards fluid overload related to the heart."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 373.7,
      "end_seconds": 378.63,
      "duration_seconds": 4.93,
      "text": "Sorry, what was I saying, is this serious, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 379.27,
      "end_seconds": 389.47,
      "duration_seconds": 10.2,
      "text": "It's reasonable to be concerned, but right now fluid overload related to the heart is my leading thought, not anything worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 406.01,
      "end_seconds": 432.54,
      "duration_seconds": 26.53,
      "text": "I'm going to order a chest X-ray, for breathlessness. Weigh yourself every morning, and tell us if you put on more than two kilos in a few days. Keep an eye out, and if the breathlessness gets worse or you can't lie down at all, call us the same day or go to emergency. Right, I think we're done unless you have questions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 434.0,
      "end_seconds": 436.1,
      "duration_seconds": 2.1,
      "text": "Alright, thanks, take care."
    }
  ]
}